### Variables
@apiVersion = /api/admin

###
### ============================================
### PROCESS ENDPOINTS - LIST PROCESSES (PAGINATED)
### ============================================
###

### List Processes - Success (Super Admin)
# @name listProcesses
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### List Processes - Success (Admin)
# @name listProcessesAdmin
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### List Processes - Success (Secretary)
# @name listProcessesSecretary
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### List Processes - Without Authentication
# Should return 401 Unauthorized
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes
Accept: application/json

###
### ============================================
### PROCESS FILTERS
### ============================================
###

### Filter by Process Number
# @name filterByProcessNumber
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?process_number=PRO-0001
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Filter by Complainant Document Number
# @name filterByComplainantDocument
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?complainant_document_number=1234567890
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Filter by Doctor Name
# @name filterByDoctorName
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?doctor_name=Juan
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Filter by Start Date
# @name filterByStartDate
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?start_date=2024-01-15
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Filter by Date Range (From and To)
# @name filterByDateRange
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?start_date_from=2025-01-02&start_date_to=2025-02-12
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Filter by Date Range From (Only)
# @name filterByDateRangeFrom
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?start_date_from=2025-01-02
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Filter by Date Range To (Only)
# @name filterByDateRangeTo
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?start_date_to=2025-02-12
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Filter by Status - Draft
# @name filterByStatusDraft
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?status=borrador
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Filter by Status - In Progress
# @name filterByStatusInProgress
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?status=in_progress
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Filter by Status - Closed
# @name filterByStatusClosed
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?status=closed
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Multiple Filters Combined
# @name filterMultiple
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?process_number=PRO-0001&start_date=2024-01-15&status=in_progress&per_page=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Multiple Filters with Date Range
# @name filterMultipleWithDateRange
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?start_date_from=2025-01-02&start_date_to=2025-02-12&status=in_progress&per_page=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###
### ============================================
### PAGINATION
### ============================================
###

### Pagination - Custom Per Page
# @name paginationCustom
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?per_page=25
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Pagination - Page 2
# @name paginationPage2
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?page=2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Pagination with Filters
# @name paginationWithFilters
GET {{base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/processes?doctor_name=Juan&per_page=10&page=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

